-- academic principal's week (§§63–64).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-63`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: gives principals who
-- are not academics the academics' week (§63), a principal's, a management
-- post §30(א)(5) leaves out (convention instruments.hours-law-teaching).

§ `76 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מנהלים קיימים שאינם אקדמאים`

@ref akn:art_76
`a non-academic principal's weekly hours` MEANS `a principal's weekly hours`

#ASSERT `a non-academic principal's weekly hours` EQUALS 40
